1
00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:04,010
(Leonard:)Amy, it's your turn.
We need one more hit. Finish him off.

2
00:00:04,183 --> 00:00:06,653
(Amy:)Here we go. Fifteen.

3
00:00:06,819 --> 00:00:09,079
(Howard:)It's a hit, the dragon collapses to the ground.

4
00:00:09,255 --> 00:00:11,845
(Sheldon:)Wait, wait.

5
00:00:12,024 --> 00:00:14,014
(Howard:)And says...

6
00:00:15,895 --> 00:00:19,195
"Mother? Is that you?

7
00:00:21,033 --> 00:00:24,403
Your little boy is coming home."

8
00:00:27,640 --> 00:00:31,510
I don't know about you guys, but I've been
through the emotional wringer tonight.

9
00:00:31,878 --> 00:00:36,778
(Bernadette:)This may be the potion talking, but you are
one fine-ass Dungeon Master.

10
00:00:36,949 --> 00:00:40,179
(Howard:)When we get home,
I'm gonna take you on a different adventure.

11
00:00:41,387 --> 00:00:44,847
(Sheldon:)Another quest by Wolowitz?
Count me in.

12
00:00:46,726 --> 00:00:51,026
- Sheldon, they're talking about sex.
- Oh, then I'm out.

13
00:00:53,532 --> 00:00:55,192
(Penny:)Ooh, I have an idea.

14
00:00:55,368 --> 00:00:56,958
(Penny:)Since it's not happening
anytime soon...

15
00:00:57,169 --> 00:01:01,019
(Penny:)...why don't your character
and your character do it in the game?

